                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "X2Ao2e",
                  "name": "why",
                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Why: Atkinson Hyperlegible is designed for maximum legibility — the body face itself backs the repo's WCAG story. Fraunces gives the editorial voice; JetBrains Mono is the engineering register. All three self-hosted as woff2 (font-display: block, preload in the root layout) — the capture-determinism rule. This tile records the WHY; the full type scale reference lives on board 01 → Prose Typeset.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
