                              "fill": "$text",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "When an autonomous pipeline owns your components, every merge is a wager that nothing visible broke. The gate turns that wager into a measurement: capture every story in a pinned browser, diff against committed baselines, block the PR when pixels move.",
